---
import ContentPageLayout from '../../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import FeatureItem from '../../components/FeatureItem.astro';
---

<ContentPageLayout
  title="SOC Stack Bundle"
  description="Complete security operations center stack: SIEM, EDR, threat intelligence, vulnerability management, and incident response tools."
  heroTitle='SOC Stack <span class="highlight">Bundle</span>'
  heroSubtitle="Complete security operations center stack ready for deployment"
  ctaTitle="Ready to Deploy the SOC Stack?"
  ctaDescription="Request bundle specifications or discuss your use case with our team."
  ctaPrimaryButton={{ text: 'Request Bundle Spec', href: '/contact' }}
  ctaSecondaryButton={{ text: 'View All Bundles', href: '/bundles' }}
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Complete SOC Stack</h2>
          <p>The SOC Stack bundle includes everything you need to run a modern security operations center: <span class="tooltip-trigger">SIEM<span class="tooltip-inline">Security Information and Event Management</span></span>, <span class="tooltip-trigger">EDR<span class="tooltip-inline">Endpoint Detection and Response</span></span>, threat intelligence, vulnerability management, and incident response tools.</p>
          <p>All tools are pre-configured, integrated, and ready for deployment. This bundle works with our SOC-in-a-Box platform or can be deployed standalone.</p>
          <h3>What's Included</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>SIEM</strong> - Security information and event management</li>
            <li><strong>EDR</strong> - Endpoint detection and response</li>
            <li><strong>Threat Intelligence</strong> - Integrated threat feeds and analysis</li>
            <li><strong>Vulnerability Management</strong> - Asset discovery and scanning</li>
            <li><strong>Log Aggregation</strong> - Centralized logging and analysis</li>
            <li><strong>Incident Response Tools</strong> - Playbooks and automation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="content-text">
          <h2>Deployment Options</h2>
          <p>The SOC Stack bundle can be deployed in multiple environments:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cloud</strong> - Deploy in AWS, Azure, or GCP</li>
            <li><strong>On-Premises</strong> - Deploy in your data center</li>
            <li><strong>Hybrid</strong> - Mix of cloud and on-premises</li>
            <li><strong>Air-Gapped</strong> - Fully isolated environments</li>
          </ul>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">Who It's For</h3>
          <p>Organizations looking to build or enhance their security operations center capabilities. Perfect for teams that want a complete, integrated SOC stack without the complexity of selecting and integrating individual tools.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-image-section overlay-full">
    <img src="/images/site/soc-bundle-bg.jpg" alt="" class="bg-image" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="bg-image-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 2;">
      <SectionHeader title="Bundle Components" />
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <FeatureItem
          title="SIEM Platform"
          description="Centralized security event management with correlation, alerting, and reporting capabilities."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="EDR Solution"
          description="Endpoint detection and response with real-time threat detection and automated response."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Threat Intelligence"
          description="Integrated threat feeds and analysis tools for proactive threat detection."
        />
        <FeatureItem
          title="Vulnerability Scanner"
          description="Asset discovery and vulnerability scanning with prioritization and reporting."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentPageLayout>
